@startuml Sequence - Login & Legacy Activation
!theme plain
skinparam monochrome true

actor User
participant FE as "Web"
participant Auth
participant MTA as "Email/SMS"
participant CI as "PhoneID"
participant Admin as "Compliance"

== Standard Login ==
User -> FE : Enter email + password
FE -> Auth : Authenticate
Auth --> FE : Session/JWT
FE --> User : Logged in

== Legacy user activation (no CI) ==
User -> FE : Open activation page
FE -> MTA : Send email OTP
MTA --> User : OTP code
User -> FE : Submit OTP
FE -> CI : Request phone verification
CI --> FE : Success/Fail
alt Asset >= Threshold
  FE -> Admin : Route to manual verification (docs upload)
  Admin --> FE : Approve/Reject
end
FE --> User : Activation complete
note right of User
  User is asked to re-login
end note

@enduml
